{
  "name": "Invoice email to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Invoice email to Google Sheets\n\n**What it does**\nWatches Gmail for emails with a PDF invoice, reads the PDF, pulls out vendor, invoice number, dates, amounts and currency with OpenAI, and adds one row per invoice to a Google Sheet.\n\n**You need**\nGmail, Google Sheets and OpenAI credentials in n8n. A sheet with the column headers listed in the README.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Connect your Gmail, Google Sheets and OpenAI credentials on the nodes that ask for them.\n2. Put your spreadsheet ID in **Add invoice row** and adjust the Gmail search in **New invoice email** if your invoices use other words.\n3. Send yourself a test invoice PDF, run the workflow once, then activate it.\n\nBuilt by AI Strike Force, aistrikeforce.com",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 500
      },
      "id": "f2f3a620-5138-4f17-a107-f66a82c2c592",
      "name": "Invoice email to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\nThe Gmail search decides which emails count as invoices. Default:\n`has:attachment filename:pdf (invoice OR receipt OR facture)`\nAdd `from:billing@supplier.example` style filters if you get noise.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 210,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "3b6c47da-7c01-4374-a5e3-b853919b50f9",
      "name": "Edit me: Gmail search",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\nPut your spreadsheet ID here. It is the long part of the sheet URL between /d/ and /edit. The tab must be called **Invoices**.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 210,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "2403742f-ad35-4c4b-aca1-1bf544bba458",
      "name": "Edit me: sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        840,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyX",
              "value": 5,
              "unit": "minutes"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "q": "has:attachment filename:pdf (invoice OR receipt OR facture)"
        },
        "options": {
          "downloadAttachments": true,
          "dataPropertyAttachmentsPrefixName": "attachment_"
        }
      },
      "id": "ec4c8eed-2855-4011-afd1-d793392add08",
      "name": "New invoice email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// An email can carry a logo, a signature image and the invoice.\n// Keep the first PDF and pass it on as \"invoice_pdf\". Emails without a PDF stop here.\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const files = item.binary || {};\n  const key = Object.keys(files).find((k) =>\n    (files[k].mimeType || '').includes('pdf') || (files[k].fileName || '').toLowerCase().endsWith('.pdf'));\n  if (!key) continue;\n  out.push({\n    json: {\n      messageId: item.json.id,\n      receivedAt: item.json.date,\n      from: item.json.from?.value?.[0]?.address || item.json.from?.text || '',\n      subject: item.json.subject || '',\n      emailText: (item.json.text || '').slice(0, 4000),\n      fileName: files[key].fileName || 'invoice.pdf',\n    },\n    binary: { invoice_pdf: files[key] },\n  });\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "185d63cc-1737-4a86-a779-657a0526de0c",
      "name": "Find the PDF attachment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "pdf",
        "binaryPropertyName": "invoice_pdf",
        "options": {
          "joinPages": true,
          "maxPages": 10
        }
      },
      "id": "8b6e9d8d-08b0-4df3-a99b-1bd5d3c30c74",
      "name": "Read PDF text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Email subject: {{ $('Find the PDF attachment').item.json.subject }}\nSender: {{ $('Find the PDF attachment').item.json.from }}\nFile name: {{ $('Find the PDF attachment').item.json.fileName }}\n\nInvoice text from the PDF:\n{{ ($json.text || '').slice(0, 30000) || '(the PDF had no readable text, use the email body below)' }}\n\nEmail body:\n{{ $('Find the PDF attachment').item.json.emailText }}",
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"vendor\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Company that issued the invoice\"\n    },\n    \"invoice_number\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"invoice_date\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\"\n    },\n    \"due_date\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"YYYY-MM-DD, empty if not stated\"\n    },\n    \"currency\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"ISO code such as USD, EUR, GBP\"\n    },\n    \"subtotal\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"tax\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"total\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"description\": \"Amount due including tax\"\n    },\n    \"description\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"What the invoice is for, under 15 words\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"vendor\",\n    \"total\",\n    \"currency\"\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {
          "systemPromptTemplate": "You read supplier invoices and return their key fields. Only use values that appear in the text. If a field is missing, return an empty string, or 0 for numbers. Dates must be YYYY-MM-DD. Amounts are plain numbers with a dot as decimal separator and no currency symbol."
        }
      },
      "id": "2fb9ba00-7ffc-419f-a453-0bf15812979d",
      "name": "Extract invoice fields",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.informationExtractor",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4.1-mini"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "id": "c155515d-a6b7-486f-a12b-e9b1ed3563f0",
      "name": "OpenAI model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        660,
        520
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
